WEBVTT

00:00:27.582 --> 00:00:30.916
so I just essentially was
a potato for the meeting.

00:00:30.940 --> 00:00:32.126
AG: The previous week,

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:35.736
Lizet had been in a virtual happy hour
for Latino leaders.

00:00:35.760 --> 00:00:38.723
LO: And I wanted to make them
laugh, and so I thought,

00:00:38.747 --> 00:00:39.905
"You know what?

00:00:39.929 --> 00:00:42.481
Next week, I'm going to try
to do some funny filters,"

00:00:42.505 --> 00:00:45.356
and so I download these Snap filters,

00:00:45.380 --> 00:00:47.438
but it didn't really download all the way.

00:00:47.462 --> 00:00:49.745
There was an error message
that kept popping up,

00:00:49.769 --> 00:00:52.486
so I kind of gave up on it
and forgot about it.

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:55.946
AG: Turns out the filters
had worked a little too well

00:00:55.970 --> 00:00:57.686
and a little too late.

00:00:57.710 --> 00:01:00.516
Now Lizet was stuck as a potato.